WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:09.460
This cushion can be a success

2
00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:13.880
because it solves a problem that a lot of people have:

3
00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:17.100
kids fall asleep in the car and wake up with a sore neck.

4
00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:19.713
Also, with an online shop I can sell all over Spain

5
00:00:19.763 --> 00:00:22.350
without having a physical store, so the costs are low.

6
00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:24.510
And most importantly: I'm really excited about it.

7
00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:29.320
What makes it so special?

8
00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:32.373
Honestly, it's very useful and cute at the same time.

9
00:00:32.423 --> 00:00:35.238
It holds the child's head so they sleep well

10
00:00:35.288 --> 00:00:39.200
and it's shaped like a puppy, so kids love it.

11
00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:43.398
Many products are only practical or only cute.

12
00:00:43.448 --> 00:00:45.304
This one has both.

13
00:00:45.354 --> 00:00:48.430
What makes it special is that it adapts:

14
00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:51.830
it's ergonomic and fits perfectly.

15
00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:55.920
It's a cute, really good product, and it solves a problem in the long run.

16
00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:04.350
The problem this product solves is that,

17
00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:06.686
when a child sleeps in the car,

18
00:01:06.736 --> 00:01:09.915
their head falls to one side and they sleep badly.

19
00:01:09.965 --> 00:01:12.526
They wake up crying during the trip

20
00:01:12.576 --> 00:01:15.344
because their head falls to one side.

21
00:01:15.394 --> 00:01:18.030
Basically, what it does is...

22
00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:21.290
...with this cushion they can sleep much better,

23
00:01:21.340 --> 00:01:24.620
their head stays supported and never falls.

24
00:01:25.130 --> 00:01:27.930
So the child can rest much better.

25
00:01:29.590 --> 00:01:32.240
To all parents,

26
00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:36.780
or anyone who has doubts: think about your last trip.

27
00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:40.310
I'm sure your child slept with their head hanging

28
00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:42.280
and woke up in a bad mood.

29
00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:44.946
This cushion prevents that.

30
00:01:44.996 --> 00:01:48.777
It hooks onto the seat belt in a few seconds

31
00:01:48.827 --> 00:01:52.000
and fits right here.

32
00:01:52.330 --> 00:01:54.810
And that way they'd sleep much better.

33
00:01:56.180 --> 00:01:59.200
It lasts for many years. It's the best.

34
00:02:00.210 --> 00:02:01.710
Thank you very much for watching.

35
00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:03.350
And I'm ready for my next trip.
